# Corpus text never enters the repository, even in results, and even though the
# CFPB has already scrubbed it and published it. This file is 100 verbatim
# narratives drawn for hand inspection; it regenerates from seed 20260806 via
# `make m0`, so committing it would add real complaint text to git history for
# no reproducibility benefit at all.
